Aquitania:
- Serene Vineyards: +1% Tile Output for each positive Stability.
- Cultivated Estates: +1% Land Tax for each Tile Upgrade.
- Hillfort Bastion: +1% all tiles' Defense for each core Hill tile

Narbonensis:
- Municipal Privilege: Core tiles get +1 Building Slot
- Maritime Prosperity: Harbour gives +10% Trade Profit
- Commercial Alliances: Each diplomatic treaty gives +1 Trade Capacity

Belgica:
- Ranged Predominance: +1% War Power for each 1% of Ranged composition
- Bravest of the Gauls: +1 General Skill Point after winning a war
- Martial Society: +1% War Power for each 1% of Actual Conscription

0.10 Plan:
- Senate Action: Boost Social Class Loyalty
- Senate Action: Boost Prestige